DESCRIPTION:Join in on the fun at Dirac Science Library for the sixth annual Dirac-ula Fall Festival. Gather with us as we celebrate the life and legacy of Paul Dirac. Grab a green wristband at the check-in table to get every treat we have to offer: a photo booth\, snacks from Seminole Dining\, face painting\, games\, prizes and more (while supplies last)!\n\nEnter our Costume Contest @ the event between 3:00-5:30pm – vote on our Instagram stories starting after the event! Round 1 will go from Wednesday-Thursdsay\, with the final round going from Thursday-Friday! We'll announce the winner on our stories and contact them on Friday\, October 30!   \n\nDate: Wednesday\, October 28 \n\nTime: 3PM-6PM\n\nLocation: Legacy Walk outside of Dirac
GEO:30.44502;-84.299845
LOCATION:Dirac Science Library (DSL)
SUMMARY:Dirac-ula Fall Fest 2026
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.fsu.edu/event/dirac-ula-fall-2026
CATEGORIES:Special Events
END:VEVENT
